  "notes": "Image 1 is a photo of the Wio-LR2021 castellated module with labelled, numbered pads. Image 2 is a schematic symbol (WIO-LR2021) with pin numbers but no physical pad positions, so no connector is transcribed from it (rule 8); its names match image 1 except it prints NSS/SCK/MOSI/MISO/RESET instead of SPI_NSS/SPI_SCK/SPI_MOSI/SPI_MISO/NRST."
